# apps/payments is the only runtime that receives PortOne server credentials.
# For local development, create the four Secrets Store entries referenced by wrangler.jsonc:
#   payments-portone-api-secret-staging
#   portone-webhook-secret-test
#   payments-core-client-token
#   payments-core-events-token
#
# The Store ID and test channel map are public and already pinned in wrangler.jsonc. Run `wrangler dev --env stg`
# together with the app Workers when exercising Service Bindings locally.
